            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="project-results" id="results">
            <div class="section-label">Results</div>
            <h2>What we delivered</h2>

            <div class="metrics-grid">
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <span class="metric-number">6</span>
                    <span class="metric-label">Can designs</span>
                    <p class="metric-description">One coherent visual system across all flavours</p>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <span class="metric-number">7</span>
                    <span class="metric-label">Cities</span>
                    <p class="metric-description">Tour motion design and visual identity — After Effects production</p>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <span class="metric-number">2 years</span>
                    <span class="metric-label">Active scaling</span>
                    <p class="metric-description">Continuous creative direction from launch through national
                        distribution</p>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <span class="metric-number">4.5 ★</span>
                    <span class="metric-label">Wildberries rating</span>
                    <p class="metric-description">Across 2,571 verified ratings — 13,359 units sold on the platform alone, plus offline retail and previous Ozon distribution</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="project-shipped" id="shipped">
            <div class="section-label">What shipped</div>
            <p class="shipped-text">The brand launched and scaled across two years of national distribution. Live on Wildberries with 13,359+ units sold and a 4.5 ★ average across 2,571 verified ratings — plus offline retail and earlier distribution on Ozon. The visual system held coherent across packaging, the 7-city tour, racing sponsorships, merch, and event materials.</p>
            <a href="https://eazyenergy.ru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; margin-right: 20px; color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;">Brand site →</a>
            <a href="https://www.wildberries.ru/seller/4043362" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;">Wildberries seller →</a>
        </section>

        <section class="next-project" id="next">
            <div class="section-label">Next project</div>
            <a href="/projects/scoville" class="next-project-link">
                <span class="next-project-name">Scoville</span>
                <span class="next-project-arrow">→</span>
            </a>
        </section>

        <section class="cta-section" id="cta">
            <h2>Launching a new product?</h2>
            <p class="contact-subtitle contact-subtitle-margin">
                Tell me about the challenge — I'll tell you where to start.
            </p>
            <a href="https://cal.com/artemandrosov/intro" target="_blank" class="btn-primary" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book an intro call</a>
            <p style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.875rem; opacity: 0.7;">or email <a href="mailto:art.androsov@gmail.com" style="color: inherit;">art.androsov@gmail.com</a></p>
        </section>

        <Footer />
</ProjectLayout>
